  "notes": [
    "Compressor internal terminal (C/S/R) grounding and exact SR terminal 5 wiring were partially obscured by overlapping leads; SR terminal 5 connection to the start capacitor/relay circuit could not be traced with certainty and was omitted.",
    "The ST (start thermistor) and SC/SR start-assist grouping under 'NOTE #8' is a hard-start accessory; internal jumper between SR terminal 2 and terminal 5 was not clearly legible and was not asserted.",
    "CTD internal LOGIC block pin mapping (T1/T2/T3) inferred from the drawn box labels; the internal contact routing inside the LOGIC box is not a traceable conductor.",
    "Dashed field-wiring (blower/thermostat/external 24V) shown as control wiring; the exact indoor blower motor terminal designations are not printed, so generic terminals were used.",
    "Right-hand SCHEMATIC DIAGRAM was cropped at the page edge; only the CONNECTION DIAGRAM was fully traced."
  ],
  "schema_version": "1"
